..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : FOP.SUCHEXT
.. Autor          : uko
.. Verantwortlich : uko
.. Kontrolle      : thge, lei
.. Funktion       : Individuelle Konfiguration der URL
..                  der Suche in Verweisfeldern
.. Functionality  : Individual configuration of URL
..                  for full text search in reference fields
..*****************************************************************************
..

.. xnosearch
..   false (default) -> Full text search will be initiated
..   true            -> Full text search will not be initiated
.assign U|xnosearch = G|false

.. xindex
..   index that should be used
..assign U|xindex = "60080"


.. xindexhtml
..   default  : taken from configuration file of mapping model with idno 'xindex'
..              e.g. http://localhost:11666/ui/{1}/Search60011.html
..                   the {1} is needed for localization
..   Attention:
..     This will overwrite the xindex parameter.
..


..
.. xgrliste
..   list of relevant groups, e.g. "3:1;3:2;4:1;4:2"

..
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
